#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""zure — identifier conflicts between recent commits and the uncommitted tree.

One changeset is already committed (a history window ending at HEAD).
The other is the working tree: staged, unstaged, and untracked.
git commit will record both as linear history. zure reports the crossed
definition/use edits that `git diff` of the dirty tree does not show.
"""

